    "articleId": "6ed3e153eb83ae669898",
    "status": "ready",
    "html": "<section><p><span><span><span>Kuikly 是腾讯开源的高性能跨端框架，基于 Kotlin Multiplatform 技术，覆盖 Android、iOS、HarmonyOS、H5、微信小程序、Mac 六大平台，支撑业务日活用户超5亿。</span></span></span><span><span><span>折叠屏产品发展迅速，</span></span></span><span><span><span>苹果</span></span></span><span><span><span>新推出的</span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;<span><span><span>iPhone Duo</span></span></span> 带来了不同以往的布局和交互方式，对于跨端页面来说需要处理更多平台差异</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>带</span></span></span><span><span><span>来了更多适配工作。</span></span></span><span><span><span>Kuikly 采用<span><span><span>原生 UI 渲染</span></span></span>，可以很好适配系统的新特性，</span></span></span><span><span><span>本文结合具体示例，介绍如何借助 Kuikly 复用跨端代码，做好折叠屏</span></span></span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span><span><span><span>适配</span></span></span><span><span><span>工作。</span></span></span></p></section><h2 id=\"section-背景\"><span><span><span>背景</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-背景\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：背景\">#</a></h2><p><span><span>过往</span></span><span><span><span>折叠屏适配的核心，主要</span></span></span><span><span><span>围绕</span></span></span><span><span><span>处理开合、旋转与分屏场景引发的</span></span></span><span><span><span>视图</span></span></span><span><span><span>尺寸变更</span></span></span><span><span><span>做处理</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>对于</span></span></span><span><span><span>跨端页面，基于响应式布局并</span></span></span><span><span><span>结合</span></span></span><span><span><span>四边<span><span><span>安全区域</span></span></span>适配，基本可以覆盖绝大多数</span></span></span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span><span><span><span>场景。</span></span></span><span><span><span>而&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>iPhone Duo&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>引入全新的设备特征</span></span></span><span><span><span>：屏幕存在多处需要避让的局部区域，同时导航栏、工具栏由系统跟随设备形态动态调整。</span></span></span><span><span><span>这一变化</span></span></span><span><span><span>对跨端页面适配构成新的约束：若维持跨端层自绘导航栏、工具栏的方案，</span></span></span><span><span><span>不仅</span></span></span><span><span><span>避让区域计算逻辑复杂度高，且无法</span></span></span><span><span><span>对齐</span></span></span><span><span><span>原生</span></span></span><span><span><span>的交互</span></span></span><span><span><span>行为。</span></span></span><span><span><span>为了实现最佳效果，似乎只能由各</span></span></span><span><span><span>平台差异化实现，</span></span></span><span><span><span>牺牲</span></span></span><span><span><span>跨端方案的效率优势。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>针对</span></span></span><span><span><span>这一问题，</span></span></span><span><span><span>Kuikly&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>依托</span></span></span><span><span><span>原生 UI 渲染</span></span></span><span><span><span>的优势，</span></span></span><span><span><span>在原有响应式布局和安全</span></span></span><span><span><span>区域能力</span></span></span><span><span><span>基础上</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>进一步</span></span></span><span><span><span>对齐系统能力</span></span></span><span><span><span>，提供</span></span></span><span><span><span>保留</span></span></span><span><span><span>区域信息</span></span></span><span><span><span>与系统导航栏工具栏的原生桥接，</span></span></span><span><span><span>侧边栏位的布局与</span></span></span><span><span><span>行为</span></span></span><span><span><span>交由系统原生组件处理，而页面结构、按钮配置与交互逻辑仍在跨端代码里统一维护，兼顾了原生体验与跨端效率。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-折叠屏基本特点\"><span><span><span>折叠屏基本特点</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-折叠屏基本特点\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：折叠屏基本特点\">#</a></h2><p><span><span>屏幕更大。</span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;展开后的内屏接近一台小平板，一屏能显示的内容比普通手机多不少。很多原来要翻几页、点几次才能看到的信息，现在可以放在同一屏里。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>屏幕尺寸会变。</span><span>用户随时可能把手机合上或打开，App 会在外屏和内屏之间切换，拿到的宽高也跟着变。打开后再分屏或旋转，可用空间还会继续变化。按开合程度，划分三种形态：</span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span>折叠态：合上后使用较小的外屏，适合单栏聚焦。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>展开态：完全展开，更大的屏幕，适合充分展示内容。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>悬停态</span></span></span>：半折状态，适合分开呈现内容和操作。</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span>折叠屏的特点</span></span></span><span><span><span>给页面设计和开发带来了新的要求：布局要随屏幕尺寸调整，也要用好更大的空间，让内容展示和操作更高效。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-iphone-duo-新变化\"><span><span><span>iPhone Duo 新变化</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-iphone-duo-新变化\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：iPhone Duo 新变化\">#</a></h2><section><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Ou8TNK0X3PFsYF6PIOA4NJHBb1aIJKaFql8XGkf7lriQgAA/641\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></section><p><span><span>图片1&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>iPhone Duo的各形态</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>iPhone Duo&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>区别于以往的折叠屏适配，</span></span></span><span><span><span>还要关注</span></span></span><span><span><span>额外的变化</span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>Vertical Controls</span></span></span>（垂直控制栏）</span></span></span><span><span><br></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span>i</span></span></span><span><span><span>Phone Duo 最容易被用户感知到的变化，是系统控制区的位置。</span></span></span><span><span><span>过去所有折叠屏设备在系统控制区位置都是沿用直板手机形态，顶部导航，底部 Tab Bar，中间内容。但苹果在折叠屏上</span></span></span><span><span><span>把</span></span></span><span><span><span>导航</span></span></span><span><span><span>栏</span></span></span><span><span><span>、工具栏和 Tab 控制放到屏幕侧边</span></span></span><span><span><span>，为内容留出更多纵向空间。</span></span></span><span><span><span>而且在分屏情况下，状态栏会分别出现在左右两侧，</span></span></span><span><span><span>系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>响应式</span></span></span><span><span><span>容器</span></span></span><span><span><span>会有相对应自适应能力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br></span></p><section><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OhCMSEaP_NPY_-UfuzF5OD5Dab2Z9goQD7JdeqQ10_NukAA/641\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></section><p><span><span>图片</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span></span><span><span>iPhone Duo的垂直控制栏</span></span></p><ul><li><h3 id=\"section-reserved-regions-保留区域\"><span><span><span><span><span><span>Reserved Regions</span></span></span>（保留区域）</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-reserved-regions-保留区域\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Reserved Regions（保留区域）\">#</a></h3></li></ul><p><span><span><span>过去</span></span></span><span><span><span>布局主要通过安全区避开系统 UI。</span></span></span><span><span><span>在</span></span></span><span><span><span>iPhone Duo</span></span></span><span><span><span>上，</span></span></span><span><span><span>还要关注屏幕内部的摄像头和折叠位置。内外屏摄像头可能占用局部空间，设备部分展开时，中间的折叠区域也会影响内容排列。苹果通过预留区域描述这些位置及其生效状态，App 可以据此避开遮挡，或把内容安排到折叠区域两侧。</span></span></span></p><section><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OBpZiXWTg_46V0shSJwEcf_iI4zZ6WyWdzD17zbpG_P1UAA/641\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></section><p><span><span>图</span></span><span><span>片3</span></span><span></span><span><span>iPhone Duo的保留区域</span></span></p><p><span><span>苹果官方给出的设备指南是：「可调整大小是你的 App 在 iPhone Duo 上的关键功能。如果你的 App 已在 iPad 和 Mac 上运行，或者你已在 iPhone Mirroring 中准备好让 App 调整大小，那么你已经为支持 iPhone Duo 打下了坚实基础。如果没有，请采用标准布局控件和容器，并使用大小类和场景几何来改进 App 的大小调整功能。然后，处理保留区域（例如折叠区域）来调整 App 大小并处理折叠布局。评估排列视图是否可以协助 App 布局来处理折叠区域。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>在某些姿态下，iPhone Duo 会将导览栏、工具栏和标签栏一起垂直显示在显示屏侧边。请检查并整理 App 中的栏，以确保常用控制始终可见，且在空间有限时，较少使用的控制会出现在溢出菜单中。」</span></span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-跨端适配痛点\"><span><span><span>跨端适配痛点</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-跨端适配痛点\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：跨端适配痛点\">#</a></h2><p><span><span><span>对跨端页面来说，难点在于复用同一套代码的同时，还要适应各端不同的系统行为。</span></span><span><span><span>布局可以</span></span></span><span><span>随尺寸调整，但安全区、折叠区域、系统栏的位置和行为需要分别接入；单栏切换到多栏时，还要保持页面跳转、返回和操作状态的一致。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这些差异都交</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>给</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>使用方处理，页面中就会增加大量平台判断，未来还可能出现更多设备形态，逐</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>端、逐页适配的成本会持续增加。因此，跨端框架需要把通用布局和交互留给业务复用，将设备差异封装成可用的能力，既减轻适配负担，也让页面能够利用各端的设备特性</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>这也是 Kuikly 的适配思路。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>总体可以把适配划分成两部分：通用的尺寸和布局变化，以及预留区域、系统侧栏等设备特有的能力。Kuikly 采用原生 UI 渲染，前者可以沿用已有的响应式布局，后者通过预留区域、系统导航栏和工具栏等实现原生能力的接入，业务页面仍然使用 Kuikly 配置内容和交互。下面结合具体示例，看看现有页面如何适配折叠屏，并利用 Duo 的设备特性。</span></span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-kuikly-适配指南\"><span><span><span>Kuikly 适配指南</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-kuikly-适配指南\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Kuikly 适配指南\">#</a></h2><h3 id=\"section-1-布局随可用空间变化\"><span><span>1. 布局随可用空间变化</span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-1-布局随可用空间变化\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：1. 布局随可用空间变化\">#</a></h3><p><span><span><span>Kuikly 从一开始就支持响应式刷新和 Flex 布局。折叠、展开或分屏带来的尺寸变化，可以沿用这套机制处理。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>在&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>att</span></span></span><span><span><span>r</span></span></span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>中使用&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>pageData.pageVi</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>ewWidt</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>h</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>和</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>pageData.pageViewHeight</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;计算尺寸，宿主上报尺寸变化后，相关布局属性会自动更新。结合&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>flex(1f)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>分配剩余空间，可以减少固定尺寸和手动高度计算。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>展开后不必一味拉伸。阅读、表单等内容可限制最大宽度并居中，多出的空间用于留白、增加列表列数或展示详情。</span></span></span></p><section><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><pre><code><span><span>// KuiklyDSL</span></span></code><code><span>View {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; attr {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; flex(<span>1f</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; View {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; attr { &nbsp;</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; width(ctx.pageData.pageViewWidth *&nbsp;<span>0.8f</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; maxWidth(<span>600f</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; } &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;}</span></code><code><span>}</span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span><span>// Kuikly ComposeDSL</span></span></code><code><span><span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>pageWidth</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;LocalConfiguration.current.<span>pageViewWidth</span></span></code><code><span><span>Box</span><span>(Modifier.width(minOf(pageWidth *&nbsp;</span><span><span>0.8f</span></span><span>,&nbsp;</span><span><span>600f</span></span><span>)</span>.dp)) {&nbsp;</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>/* ... */</span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span>}&nbsp;</span></code></pre></section><p><span><span><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/GP55jSF5MF57isTzJSWtY2X473t6vrofG6P2ZPTL-SIvUAA/0\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></span></span></p><p><span><span>图</span></span><span><span>片4</span></span><span></span><span><span>折叠屏展开页面布局变化样例</span></span></p><h3 id=\"section-2-安全区域和避让\"><span><span>2. 安全区域和避让</span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-2-安全区域和避让\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：2. 安全区域和避让\">#</a></h3><p><span><span><span>安全区域仍然是多设备适配的关键。不同设备的刘海、系统栏和手势区域不同，文字和操作控件需要按当前安全</span></span></span><span><span><span>区域</span></span></span><span><span><span>避让。旋转、分屏或开合时，安全距离也可能变化，布局应随之更新，而不是预留固定的顶部、底部间距。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>Kuikly 通过</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>pageDat</span></span></span><span><span><span>a.safeA</span></span></span><span><span><span>reaIn</span></span></span><span><span><span>set</span></span></span><span><span><span>s</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;提供上、下、左、右的安全距离。</span></span></span><span><span><span>把安全区域</span></span></span><span><span><span>绑定到内容边距，就能随安全区变化调整布局：</span></span></span></p><section><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><pre><code><span><span>// KuiklyDSL</span></span></code><code><span>View {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; attr {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; flex(<span>1f</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; paddingTop(ctx.pageData.safeAreaInsets.top)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; paddingLeft(ctx.pageData.safeAreaInsets.left)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; paddingBottom(ctx.pageData.safeAreaInsets.bottom)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; paddingRight(ctx.pageData.safeAreaInsets.right)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>// 需要安全区保护的前景内容</span></span></code><code><span>}</span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span><span>// Kuikly ComposeDSL</span></span></code><code><span><span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>configuration</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;LocalConfiguration.current</span></code><code><span>configuration.pageViewWidth &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span>// 订阅尺寸变化</span></span></code><code><span><span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>safe</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;configuration.pageData.<span>safeAreaInsets</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span><span>Box</span><span>(Modifier.fillMaxSize()</span>.background(bgColor)) { &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span>// 背景铺满</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; Column(</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Modifier.fillMaxSize().absolutePadding(</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; left = safe.left.dp, top = safe.top.dp,</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; right = safe.right.dp, bottom = safe.bottom.dp,</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; ) {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>// 需要安全区保护的前景内容</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>}</span></code></pre></section><p><span><span>过去</span></span><span><span><span>App做适配</span></span></span><span><span><span>页面主要用 Top 和 Bottom 处理避让</span></span></span><span><span><span>导航栏和底部状态栏</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>而</span></span></span><span><span><span>Duo 的导航栏和工具栏可能移到侧边，因此也要关注&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>l</span></span></span><span><span><span>eft、right，并结合系统栏的实际占位处理左右空间，不能只留上下边距</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>在</span></span></span><span><span><span>iPhoneDuo</span></span></span><span><span><span>上，除了</span></span></span><span><span><span>安全区域外</span></span></span><span><span><span>，还要关注预留区域，处理摄像头</span></span></span><span><span><span>、状态栏</span></span></span><span><span><span>遮挡和折叠带来的布局限制。</span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span>遮挡区域</span></span></span><span><span><span>：避免文字、按钮等关键内容与它重叠。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>分割区域</span></span></span><span><span><span>：需要分区的页面，可以把内容安排到折叠区域两侧；</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span>Kuikly 通过&nbsp;</span></span><span><span><span>pageData.reservedRegions</span></span></span><span><span>&nbsp;提供区域的位置、大小、类型和当前是否生效</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>区域使用 x、y、width、height 描述，坐标相对 Kuikly 根视图</span></span></span><span><span><span>，计算规避后的坐标</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>如果希望背景、图片等内容延伸到顶部，可以不对整页统一添加&nbsp;</span></span><span><span><span>paddingTop</span></span></span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span><span><span>pageData.reservedRegions</span></span></span><span><span>&nbsp;对当前生效的遮挡区域做局部避让。</span></span></span></p><section><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><pre><code><span><span>// KuiklyDSL</span></span></code><code><span>View {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; attr {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>pageWidth</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;ctx.pageData.pageViewWidth</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>occlusion</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;ctx.pageData.reservedRegions.firstOrNull {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; it.active &amp;&amp; it.kind == ReservedRegionKind.OCCLUSION &amp;&amp; it.x &gt;= pageWidth /&nbsp;<span>2f</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>// 伪代码：有右侧遮挡时，避让右边位置 right&nbsp;</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>paddingRight</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;<span>if</span>&nbsp;(occlusion !=&nbsp;<span>null</span>) pageWidth - occlusion.x +&nbsp;<span>12f</span>&nbsp;<span>else</span>&nbsp;<span>12f</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; absolutePosition(right = paddingRight)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>}</span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span><span>// Kuikly ComposeDSL</span></span></code><code><span><span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>configuration</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;LocalConfiguration.current</span></code><code><span><span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>pageWidth</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;configuration.pageViewWidth</span></code><code><span><span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>occlusion</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;configuration.pageData.reservedRegions.firstOrNull {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; it.active &amp;&amp; it.kind == ReservedRegionKind.OCCLUSION &amp;&amp; it.x &gt;= pageWidth /&nbsp;<span>2f</span></span></code><code><span>}</span></code><code><span><span>val</span>&nbsp;<span>badgeRight</span>&nbsp;<span>=</span>&nbsp;<span>if</span>&nbsp;(occlusion !=&nbsp;<span>null</span>) pageWidth - occlusion.x +&nbsp;<span>12f</span>&nbsp;<span>else</span>&nbsp;<span>12f</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span>Box(Modifier.fillMaxSize().background(bgColor)) { &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>// 背景延伸到顶部</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; Text(</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>\"角标\"</span>,</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Modifier.align(Alignment.TopEnd)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .absolutePadding(top =&nbsp;<span>12.</span>dp, right = badgeRight.dp),</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; )</span></code><code><span>}</span></code></pre></section><p><span><span><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/GqQRCQrjCMRT4fJlqrz8oEVTErD1opGbuUFMi4Us8BkRkAA/0\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></span></span></p><p><span><span>图</span></span><span><span>片5</span></span><span><span>避让iPhone Duo的遮挡区域</span></span></p><h3 id=\"section-3-空间变大后-怎么展示内容\"><span><span>3. 空间变大后，怎么展示内容</span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-3-空间变大后-怎么展示内容\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：3. 空间变大后，怎么展示内容\">#</a></h3><p><span><span>展开后不一定要把所有元素放大。常见做法有三种：拉伸、调整布局和</span></span><span><span><span>多</span></span></span><span><span><span>栏展示，具体选哪种取决于页面内容。</span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span>拉伸：让适合扩展的内容占用更多空间</span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span>文本</span></span></span><span><span><span>、画布等内容，可以扩展显示区域。普通按钮、图标和字号通常不用跟着同比例放大。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>阅读页则要限制正文宽度，避免展开后每行文字过长。多出来的空间可以留白，不必强行填满。</span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span>调整布局：重排</span></span></span><span><span><span>页面</span></span></span><span><span><span>，或者增加列数</span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span>如：</span></span></span><span><span><span>图文卡片可以由上下排改为左右排，信息流可以增加列数。Kuikly 的</span></span></span><span><span><br></span></span><span><span><span><span>WaterfallList</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>(KuiklyDSL)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>LazyVerticalStaggeredGrid</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>(ComposeDSL)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>支持设置列表宽度和列数：</span></span></span></p><section><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><pre><code><span><span>// KuiklyDSL</span></span></code><code><span><span>WaterfallList</span>&nbsp;{</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; attr {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>flex</span>(1f)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>listWidth</span>(ctx.<span>pagerData</span>.<span>pageViewWidth</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>columnCount</span>(<span>if</span>&nbsp;(ctx.<span>pagerData</span>.<span>pageViewWidth</span>&nbsp;&gt;= 600f)&nbsp;<span>4</span>&nbsp;<span>else</span>&nbsp;<span>2</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>itemSpacing</span>(10f)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>lineSpacing</span>(10f)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>// 普通卡片不写死宽度，由列表按列宽分配</span></span></code><code><span>}</span></code><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code><code><span><span>// Kuikly ComposeDSL</span></span></code><code><span>val pageWidth =&nbsp;<span>LocalConfiguration</span>.<span>current</span>.<span>pageViewWidth</span></span></code><code><span><span>LazyVerticalStaggeredGrid</span>(</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; columns =&nbsp;<span>StaggeredGridCells</span>.<span>Fixed</span>(<span>if</span>&nbsp;(pageWidth &gt;= 600f)&nbsp;<span>4</span>&nbsp;<span>else</span>&nbsp;<span>2</span>),</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; modifier =&nbsp;<span>Modifier</span>.<span>fillMaxSize</span>(),</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; verticalItemSpacing =&nbsp;<span>10.</span>dp, &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span>// 对应 lineSpacing</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; horizontalArrangement =&nbsp;<span>Arrangement</span>.<span>spacedBy</span>(<span>10.</span>dp), &nbsp;<span>// 对应 itemSpacing</span></span></code><code><span>) {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>items</span>(<span>feed, key = { it.id }</span>) { item -&gt;</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>FeedCard</span>(item,&nbsp;<span>Modifier</span>.<span>fillMaxWidth</span>()) &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>// 卡片不写死宽度，由网格按列宽分配</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>}</span></code></pre></section><p><span><span><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/G6GnjEby9qLNrhl8PpSvuhgt1jdC3AGjRnft7-1aP8U80AA/0\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></span></span></p><p><span><span>图</span></span><span><span>片6</span></span><span><span>瀑布流列数随屏幕大小展开</span></span></p><h4><span><span><span>双栏：同时展示有关联的内容</span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span>列表与详情、目录与正文等关联内容，可以在宽屏下并排展示，窄屏下仍按单栏逐级访问。</span></span></span><span><span><span>外屏和内屏应保持一致的内容和操作逻辑，展开后只是把原来分步查看的信息同时呈现，让用户感觉仍在使用同一个 App。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>详细可以参考：「</span></span></span><span><span><span>iPhone Duo来了，腾讯 Kuikly 助 App 从容适配 | 跨平台框架—tds-Kuikly</span></span></span><span><span><span>」</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/GNJtrRuO2yDVm5TcWb_HzcTnKQz6Mg6_SxIFHV8Qvdrw4AA/0\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></section></section></section><section><section><section><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Gu60ew7FYzyb7b8VucX6QhClWM7RktMSgAxdiIl0EG7TgAA/0\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>图</span></span><span><span>片7</span></span><span><span>双栏布局在折叠屏上的表现</span></span></p><h3 alt=\"双栏布局在折叠屏上的表现\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/2YTOibpx9RUBf2lfI5OHVty4ZicicgTo8LJibnoyo77hEMb408cTRf2FgBZ28sufbOTk19YCOMPPFgoDjxJYkyt6eYPibjn9Xb8yhWKRia2yRlZtE/0?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" id=\"section-4-导航栏和工具栏\"><span><span>4. 导航栏和工具栏</span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-4-导航栏和工具栏\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：4. 导航栏和工具栏\">#</a></h3><p><span><span>在 iPhone Duo 上，导航栏和工具栏可以随设备姿态和容器布局调整到侧边，为内容留出更多纵向空间。页面除了适应尺寸变化，也要跟着系统栏的位置调整内容区域。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>Kuikly</span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;DSL：</span></span></span><span><span><span>通过&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>UINavigationBar</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;和&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>UIToolbar</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;接入宿主的原生系统栏。业务侧配置标题、图标、按钮和点击事件，系统根据容器和姿态处理栏的位置与排列。例如，添加一个</span></span></span><span><span><span>返回</span></span></span><span><span><span>按钮：</span></span></span></p><section><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><pre><code><span><span>UINavigationBar</span>&nbsp;{</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; attr {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; tintColor(Color.BLACK)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; items {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; navbarItems {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; navbarItem {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; attr {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; placement(<span>UIBarButtonItemPlacement</span>.Leading)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; symbol(<span>\"chevron.backward\"</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; title(<span>\"返回\"</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; index(<span>0</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; axis(<span>UIBarAxis</span>.VerticalPreferred)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; event {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; click {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ctx.acquireModule&lt;RouterModule&gt;(RouterModule.MODULE_NAME)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .closePage()</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>}</span></code></pre></section><p><span><span>Kuikly ComposeDSL：可以用&nbsp;</span></span><span><span><span>MakeKuiklyComposeNode</span></span></span><span><span>&nbsp;挂一个 DSL 容器，在容器里声明它：</span></span></p><section><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><pre><code><span><span>@Composable</span></span></code><code><span><span><span>fun</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span><span><span>SystemNavigationBar</span></span><span><span>(onBack: () -&gt;&nbsp;</span></span><span><span><span>Unit</span></span></span><span><span>)</span></span>&nbsp;{</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>val</span>&nbsp;currentOnBack&nbsp;<span>by</span>&nbsp;rememberUpdatedState(onBack)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; MakeKuiklyComposeNode&lt;DivView&gt;(</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; factory = { DivView() },</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; modifier = Modifier.size(<span>0.</span>dp), &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span>// 系统栏只配置宿主 navigationItem，不参与布局</span></span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; viewInit = {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; UINavigationBar {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; attr { tintColor(KuiklyColor.BLACK) }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; items {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; navbarItems {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; navbarItem {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; attr {</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; placement(UIBarButtonItemPlacement.Leading)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; symbol(<span>\"chevron.backward\"</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; title(<span>\"返回\"</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; index(<span>0</span>)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; axis(UIBarAxis.VerticalPreferred)</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; event { click { currentOnBack() } }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</span></code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; )</span></code><code><span>}</span></code></pre></section><p><span><span>封装通用导航栏，统一各端的导航和避让</span></span></p><p><span><span>整体来看，跨端差异主要在系统导航栏、工具栏的使用方式和空间占位。为方便适配，业务可以封装一个通用</span></span><span><span><span>导航栏</span></span></span><span><span><span>，统一</span></span></span><span><span><span>导航</span></span></span><span><span><span>、返回按钮和工具栏配置，把各端的导航与避让集中由组件处理。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>iPhone 端接入系统导航栏和工具栏。在 Duo 的侧置布局下，根据栏的实际位置、安全区和生效的预留区域调整导航与正文空间；其他端或未接入系统栏的页面，沿用常规导航布局，按&nbsp;</span></span><span><span><span>safeAreaInsets</span></span></span><span><span>&nbsp;处理顶部、底部及所在边的安全距离。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>正文使用容器分配的剩余空间，不再重复添加安全区边距。这样，导航样式和避让规则可以集中维护，适配新设备时也不必逐页修改。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>这样既能利用 Duo 的系统侧栏等设备特性，也能让业务页面保持统一的配置方式。后续适配新设备时，主要在</span></span></span><span><span><span>组件</span></span></span><span><span><span>内部补充对应实现和避让规则，不必逐页修改。</span></span></span></p><section><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/ODJlcHU7udNrnnoOuHftWj8J9B5lVduazMMzwnT0InVEEAA/641\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></section><p><span><span>图</span></span><span><span>片8</span></span><span><span>自定义导航样例在 非iPhone / iPhone / iPhone Duo 上的表现</span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-总结\"><span><span><span>总结</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-总结\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：总结\">#</a></h2><p><span><span>新设备形态的出现，也带来了更多布局调整和平台适配工作。Kuikly 致力于通过跨端代码复用和原生能力封装，减轻业务的重复适配负担，让页面在保持一致的内容和操作逻辑同时，也能利用各端的设备特性。未来面对更多设备形态，我们也希望把通用适配能力沉淀到框架中，让业务更专注于内容和体验。</span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-参考引用\"><span><span><span>参考引用</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-参考引用\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：参考引用\">#</a></h2><h2 id=\"section-关于-kuikly\"><span><span><span>关于 Kuikly</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-关于-kuikly\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：关于 Kuikly\">#</a></h2><ul><li><section><span><span>👉&nbsp;</span><span><span><span><span>GitHub 仓库</span></span></span></span></span></section></li><li><section><span><span>📚&nbsp;</span></span><span>官方文档</span></section></li></ul><p><span><span>Kuikly 框架属于腾讯端服务联盟（tds.qq.com）的重要成员，欢迎关注及了解更多信息：</span></span></p><ul><li><section><span><span>腾讯端服务官网：</span></span><span>TDS 腾讯端服务</span></section></li><li><section><span><span>Kuikly 官网：</span></span><span>跨平台框架</span></section></li></ul>",
